{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Shelf Life Management 把到期日追蹤與購物清單結合起來，適合與家人、室友或同事共同管理食品、護膚品及藥品等日常物品。你可以用名稱或照片記錄項目，並透過 iCloud 建立各自的共享空間。程式原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>共享空間與智能購物清單</h2>\n<p>每個共享空間擁有獨立的項目、分類與位置。擁有者可管理邀請與成員，編輯者可新增、更新及刪除項目，檢視者則可查看記錄並複製到自己的空間。長按現有項目即可加入購物清單，系統會依歷史記錄顯示可存放日數、已使用與浪費次數及即期庫存。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-186-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-187-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-188-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-189-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-190-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-191-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Shelf Life Management</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-10T16:38:09.492361+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":305,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}